<section class="shell international-section difference-section" id="why-aeternus" aria-labelledby="difference-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">Why AETERNUS?</p><h2 id="difference-title">Old books deserve<br><em>more than a reprint.</em></h2></div><p class="difference-intro">Landmarks of world literature. Enduring ideas. Remarkable voices. We handpick works worth keeping and pursue the highest standards in every new edition.</p></div><div class="difference-grid"><article><span class="difference-number">01 / THE SELECTION</span><h3>Literary landmarks.<br>Chosen to endure.</h3><p>We curate highlights from humanity’s literary heritage: lasting achievements, illuminating historical voices and stories whose power endures. Every title earns its place.</p></article><article><span class="difference-number">02 / THE LANGUAGE</span><h3>The original meaning.<br>A clearer way in.</h3><p>In selected editions of older works, we renew dated language and untangle dense syntax. The ideas, events and historical character remain intact — without censorship or distortion.</p></article><article><span class="difference-number">03 / THE EDITION</span><h3>More to see.<br>More to understand.</h3><p>Restored historical images or newly created plates, considered typography, and substantial introductions or afterwords bring depth to the reading experience. Each book explains what its edition includes.</p></article></div><div class="difference-footer"><p><strong>Context, not censorship.</strong> We explain the past without editing away what makes it the past.</p><a class="text-link" href="/why-aeternus/">Discover the care behind our editions →</a></div></section>
<section class="shell international-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">The English-language programme</p><h2>A world in every volume.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/books/">All books →</a></div><div class="books-grid">{% for item in site.books %}{% if loop.index <= 4 %}{% include 'book-card.njk' %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></section>
