<section class="shell edition-story"><div class="editorial-illustration"><img src="/assets/images/mood-gruen.jpg" alt="Historical volumes and the material world of exploration" width="960" height="720" loading="lazy"></div><div><p class="kicker">Rooted in Germany’s rich literary tradition</p><h2>The source comes first.<br><em>The reader comes closer.</em></h2><p>From Germany, we bring a carefully curated and continually growing catalogue to readers around the world. Our commitment is to the highest editorial and visual standards: enduring works, thoughtfully renewed for another generation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet the publishing house →</a></div></section>

